                <invention-title lang="de">SYSTEME UND VERFAHREN ZUR ZUSAMMENFASSUNG UND VISUALISIERUNG VON TRACE-DATEN</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">SYSTÈMES ET PROCÉDÉS DE RÉSUMÉ ET DE VISUALISATION DE DONNÉES DE TRACES</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">SYSTEMS AND METHODS FOR SUMMARIZATION AND VISUALIZATION OF TRACE DATA</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The invention relates to a computer-implemented method and an apparatus for summarizing trace data comprising a plurality of time-stamped trace events to render the trace data on a display device. The method comprises pre-computing multiple levels of representations of said trace events into summary levels comprising a plurality of summary entries. Each of said summary entries is associated with one of a plurality of summary levels and represents a plurality of said trace events. Each of said summary entries is associated with a time range. A time span of each of said time ranges is the same within a summary level and is different for each summary level. The method further comprises retrieving a subset of said pre-computed summary entries from a determined one of said summary levels and rendering it on a display device.</p>
            </abstract>
